    "identity": "Persist exact created CID, expected image/config digest, role, unique run label and create response before further operations. Every subsequent Docker operation targets only the retained exact CID and checks its run/image role. No global Docker enumeration, host PID lookup, killpg, prune or unrelated cleanup.",
