      "fixed_setup": "Before tests use the existing official OTP :socket ioctl sequence to assign8.8.8.8 to lo:1; read back exact address and close setup socket. Record /proc/net/dev interfaces, /proc/net/route and namespace IDs plus Docker NetworkMode=none; require only lo, no non-loopback interface/default route and network namespace different from host. These are only future remote-owned checks.",
      "scope_of_NET_ADMIN": "Owned disposable namespace only; no host network, privileged, SYS_ADMIN, device, ingress, published port, mounted network namespace or external network. No product loopback classifier exception."
    },
    "pg": {
      "image": "database_image immutable AMD64 child",
