  "required_canonical_changes": [
    {
      "changes": [
        "Change IMAGES.test.ref and config to new immutable child/config only after amendment selection.",
        "Retain old sealed packet and add an independently sealed immutable amendment packet with new metadata; static source binding must verify both seals and select new elixir metadata while retaining old PostgreSQL metadata and177 product freeze.",
        "Update selected-contract-metadata.tar inputs and source receipt fields to bind amendment bytes; do not overwrite historical contract packet.",
        "Retain exact required executable path/stat/hash checks and actual Elixir/OTP/Mix/OpenSSL/tar commands. Add explicit CA-file path/hash/size and loaded nonempty OS-root evidence before bootstrap; capture OpenSSL library identity and package-source comparison without treating source inventory as a command result."
      ],
      "path": "hosted/scripts/test-identity-network.py"
    },
    {
      "changes": [
        "Update new selected child/config positive fixtures and old index/child rejection fixtures.",
        "Add bounded controls that reject stale/wrong amendment seal, new metadata/hash drift, missing/mismatched CA source and missing actual prerequisite result.",
        "Run existing focused collector controls after coordinated implementation; no product test/support changes."
      ],
      "path": "hosted/scripts/test_identity_network_collector.py"
    },
    {
      "changes": [
        "Link old immutable contract plus selected amendment and explain Debian Bookworm image selection.",
        "State exact tool/CA evidence and remaining remote qualification; preserve all isolation/no-install/source177 scope."
      ],
      "path": "docs/hosted-identity-production-network-ci-contract.md"
    },
    {
      "changes": [
        "Preserve historical ARM64 Noble entry. Preserve failed Noble AMD64 entry as historical failed-prerequisite evidence, recording actual failed receipt.",
        "Append exact HexPM Debian Bookworm AMD64 image index/child/config and source inventory receipt, external verification-only.",
        "Record packaged OpenSSL/libssl3 3.0.22-1~deb12u1, CA20250419~deb12u1, tar1.34+dfsg-1.2+deb12u1 and coreutils9.1-1 as image-supplied verification tool dependencies with per-component notices/license review pending.",
        "Hex2.5.1 and Rebar3.28.0 artifact URLs/SHA512 remain unchanged; runtime qualification remains pending until actual captured execution."
      ],
      "path": "THIRD_PARTY.yml"
    },
    {
      "changes": [
        "Add actual selected immutable amendment-packet path to BOTH push/pull_request paths and finite sparse-checkout; existing workflow includes only predecessor verification/identity-production-network-contract/**.",
        "Preserve runner ubuntu-24.04,15minute limit, pinned checkout/upload Actions, contents-read permissions, no persisted credentials, aggregate collector/cleanup behavior and no native/UI/runtime-local route."
      ],
      "path": ".github/workflows/identity-network.yml"
    }
  ],
