    "failure_order": "finally/cancellation freezes primary outcome first, then same exact owned-CID teardown; stop may force-kill after grace but must be labelled container teardown, not graceful product lifecycle proof. Never turn expected denial, direct-child reap, runner disposal or successful upload into absence evidence.",
    "permission_or_identity_loss": "Sticky FAILED/unknown on Docker permission refusal, ID/label/image mismatch or missing create-CID response. Do not retry denied operations via another actor/API/name/PID. Record exact uncertainty; no cleanup-pass. Do not issue blanket cleanup.",
    "creation_uncertainty": "On timed-out/lost create response without a retained CID, retain the reserved exact name/run label as unresolved. No broad name search or alternative local process route. This attempt cannot qualify; job-disposal is not an observed cleanup receipt.",
    "signals": "Host collector catches SIGINT/SIGTERM, records cancellation and stops initiating work; bounded cleanup only of its retained CIDs. Workflow uses cancel-in-progress:false and explicit always cleanup/upload steps. GitHub hard cancellation/host loss may prevent finally, cleanup or upload; missing evidence remains unqualified rather than claiming guaranteed cleanup.",
    "artifact": "Upload one identity-production-network-${github.sha}-${run_attempt} artifact with if:always(), retention14days, if-no-files-found:error. Retain source/dependency/tool manifests+safe archives, exact commands/env allowlist/timestamps/exits, image index/manifest/config, observer events, all raw outputs, actual namespace/resources, two semantic JSONs, failure partials and exact owned cleanup outcome. No private key files, token, credential directory or unbounded core dump.",
    "root_retention": "Before14day expiry root must download digest-bound accepted/failed evidence into a new repository verification packet and independently validate safe archive membership, complete bindings,2method semantics and cleanup. Workflow green/upload alone is not acceptance."
  },
  "collector_controls": {
